{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "Registro de Autos API",
    "description": "Coleccion para probar la API REST de Registro y Gestion de Autos.\n\n## Uso rapido\n1. Importa esta coleccion en Postman.\n2. Ejecuta **Auth > Login (demo)** para guardar el token JWT automaticamente.\n3. Prueba los endpoints de **Autos** (usan el token guardado).\n\n## Credenciales demo\n- Email: demo@registroautos.com\n- Password: Demo123!\n\n## Validaciones\n- Placa colombiana: 3 letras + 3 digitos (ej. MWK737)\n- Ano del auto: no puede ser futuro",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "carId",
      "value": "1"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Endpoints publicos de autenticacion.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fullName\": \"Juan Perez\",\n  \"email\": \"juan.perez@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password1\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Registra un nuevo usuario. La contrasena debe tener al menos 8 caracteres, una mayuscula y un numero."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (demo)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    if (pm.environment.name) pm.environment.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    pm.test('Token guardado en variable {{token}}', function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(json.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"demo@registroautos.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Demo123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Inicia sesion con el usuario demo. El token JWT se guarda automaticamente en la variable de coleccion `token`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (custom)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    if (pm.environment.name) pm.environment.set('token', json.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"tu-email@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"TuPassword1\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login con credenciales personalizadas. Edita email y password en el body."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Autos",
      "description": "CRUD de autos del usuario autenticado. Requiere JWT (ejecuta Login primero).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar autos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cars",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "cars"]
            },
            "description": "Lista todos los autos del usuario autenticado."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar autos (filtros)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cars?search=MWK&brand=Chevrolet&year=2020",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "cars"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "search",
                  "value": "MWK",
                  "description": "Buscar por placa o modelo"
                },
                {
                  "key": "brand",
                  "value": "Chevrolet",
                  "description": "Filtrar por marca"
                },
                {
                  "key": "year",
                  "value": "2020",
                  "description": "Filtrar por ano"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista autos con busqueda y filtros opcionales."
          },
          "response": []
